  START --> RULE_BR050
  RULE_BR050 --> DEC_FUNC
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'LOG'| RULE_BR051
  RULE_BR051 --> DEC_SEV
  DEC_SEV -->|deadlock or timeout| SEV_RETRY
  DEC_SEV -->|connection error| SEV4
  DEC_SEV -->|duplicate key or not found| SEV1
  DEC_SEV -->|other| SEV_SIGN
  SEV_RETRY --> IO_INSERT
  SEV4 --> IO_INSERT
  SEV1 --> IO_INSERT
  SEV_SIGN --> IO_INSERT
  IO_INSERT --> DEC_INS
  DEC_INS -->|yes — return code 0| TERMINAL
  DEC_INS -->|no / false| CALL_ERRPROC
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'DIAG'| RULE_BR053
  RULE_BR053 --> DEC_DIAG
  DEC_DIAG -->|deadlock or timeout — return code 4| TERMINAL
  DEC_DIAG -->|connection error — return code 12| TERMINAL
  DEC_DIAG -->|duplicate key — return code 8| TERMINAL
  DEC_DIAG -->|other — 12 if negative, else 4| TERMINAL
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'RETR'| IO_RETR
  IO_RETR --> DEC_RETR
  DEC_RETR -->|yes — return logged message| TERMINAL
  DEC_RETR -->|no — return code 4| TERMINAL
  DEC_FUNC -->|other| CALL_ERRPROC
  CALL_ERRPROC --> TERMINAL

